\textbf{Conclusion}
\$$2mm]

Each standardized innovation has the same marginal distribution,
\[
\tilde e_t\sim\mathcal N(0,1),
$$
and the standardized innovations are independent across time. Hence,

$$
\boxed{
\tilde e_t
=
\frac{e_t}{\sqrt{Q_t}}
\overset{\mathrm{i.i.d.}}{\sim}
\mathcal N(0,1)
}
$$

Therefore $\{\tilde e_t\}$ is Gaussian white noise. $\square$
